ding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a1/85gdryl48djrei22noyu1qg1lfhbp7l.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%BC%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%94%93%E5%BB%B6.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a1/85gdryl48djrei22noyu1qg1lfhbp7l.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />异念蔓延\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[被动]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）穿透伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"警戒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">警戒</font></span></span>]时，穿透伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蛊惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">蛊惑</font></span></span>]的敌人被击败时，将会对所有处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"质疑之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">质疑之种</font></span></span>]警戒范围内随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名未有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蛊惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">蛊惑</font></span></span>]的敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蛊惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">蛊惑</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%AE%89%E7%BC%87%E6%AD%8C\"